text I wake up the next morning to the sound of my phone ringing.
text It's early enough for me to want to sleep a little longer.
text I crawl out of my futon and pick up the receiver.
music BGM08D.mp3
sound MJU.aac
text @[Voice]
text "That you, Okazaki-kun?"
text It's the boss's voice.
text @[Tomoya]
text What's the matter? Why are you calling this early?
sound MJV.aac
text @[Boss]
text "It's raining too hard today, we're taking the day off."
text @[Tomoya]
text What? Really?
sound MJW.aac
text @[Boss]
text "Yeah. I called you because I talked to Yoshino and he said that he hadn't told you yet. Seems like you didn't know?"
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh.
sound MJX.aac
text @[Boss]
text "They're saying it'll clear up by tomorrow, so come to work then. We'll make a decision on the spot depending on how bad the passing showers are."
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay, I understand. Thanks as always.
sound MJY.aac
text @[Boss]
text "Keep up the good work."
text I hang up the phone. I can hear the sound of rain outside.
sound MJZ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text What happened, Tomoya-kun?
text Nagisa has woken up as well, and is now sitting right on top of the futon.
text @[Tomoya]
text Ah, work is canceled.
sound MK0.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That's... too bad.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah. But you still have school. Get some rest until then.
sound MK1.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay, that's what I'll do.
text The two of us lie back down under our blankets.
