text I wake up. It's dark outside, so I don't know what time it is.
text When I look at the clock, I see it's already past eleven.
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa!
text I leap up, only to find that the futon next to mine has been folded up. Nagisa is nowhere to be found.
text She must have gotten up and left on her own.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Of course... That's what she does every day...)
text I find a note from Nagisa next to my pillow.
text "Dear Tomoya-kun. I've made you breakfast. I'm sorry, but please prepare lunch for yourself. I'll be going now."
text While it's already close to noon, I eat the breakfast Nagisa made me.
