text @[Tomoya]
text (Okay, then...)
text Once I clean up, I start to think.
text What should I do now...
text It's not like I have any hobbies.
text I don't watch movies, and I don't listen to music. I don't play any sports either, nor do I drive a car.
text When I really think about it...
text @[Tomoya]
text (...I'm a really boring guy, aren't I?)
text I'm amazed that there was a girl out in the world who would bother to fall in love with me...
text While it may be a good idea to find myself a hobby, days when I'm all alone like today are rare ones.
text Since this isn't a frequent occurrence, even if I did pick up a solo hobby or something like that, I wouldn't keep at it for long.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Then I'll just have to figure out how to make it through today...)
text So, what should I do to kill the time?
choice Watch TV|Hunt through my drawers
