text I turn on the TV.
text While I go through all of the channels, I don't see any programs that look interesting.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Yeah, not at this hour...)
text On the screen are images of women doing a workout routine.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text I happen to be sitting with my legs in the same position as them, so I try moving along with the women.
text "One, two, three, four!"
text @[Tomoya]
text One, two, three, four.
text "This helps prevent menstrual pain, as well."
text @[Tomoya]
text Oh, huh...
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait, what am I doing?!
text A feeling of embarrassment comes over me after realizing how pathetic this is.
