text Nagisa doesn't get home until after three in the afternoon.
text I'm alone in my room.
music ~
text That's right... I can do anything I want right now...
text I reach out toward my chest of drawers.
text And there, I find Nagisa's...
text @[Tomoya]
text Hold on, what kind of perverted crap was I just about to do?!!
text I start rolling on the ground just as I open the drawer.
music BGM10.mp3
text *CLANK* *THUD* THUD* *WHOOMP*
text It comes out of the chest, causing underwear to start raining onto my head.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Oh crap!!)
text I quickly stuff the underwear back in the drawer.
text I then place it back in the chest.
text @[Tomoya]
text *Pant* *Pant*
text @[Tomoya]
text (I'm such an idiot...)
setvar intF[43] = 1
label 327
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text I never imagined that spending time alone could be this agonizing.
text I'm bored if I don't do anything. Yet at the same time, If I try to do something, I can't stand how pathetic it seems when I realize I'm doing it all alone.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Nagisa...)
text When I think about it, we've been doing everything together.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Come home soon...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (And then let's go shopping together...)
